  {
    "type": "ThingDef",
    "key": "Crebbb.description",
    "english": "A 3-legged monster that is surprisingly friendly. As a herbivore, its main source of nutritian is plantlife, as such it rarely attacks people and is generally more docile than the other Ebbbs.",
    "french": "Un monstre à trois pattes étonnamment amical. Herbivore, il se nourrit principalement de végétaux, si bien qu'il attaque rarement les gens et se montre généralement plus docile que les autres ebbbs.",
    "source": "Mod/Defs/ThingDefs_Races/Races_Ebbb.xml"
  },
