  {
    "type": "ThingDef",
    "key": "Thrumebbb.description",
    "english": "A gross mockery of the Universe's most graceful creature, the Thrumebbb is an amalgamation of Ebbbs that has somehow gained a semblance of intelligence. It is foul, and reeks of death. Beware, for it does not eat trees.",
    "french": "Parodie grotesque de la créature la plus gracieuse de l'univers, le thrumebbb est un amalgame d'ebbbs qui a acquis, on ne sait comment, un semblant d'intelligence. Il est répugnant et empeste la mort. Méfiez-vous : il ne mange pas les arbres.",
    "source": "Mod/Defs/ThingDefs_Races/Races_Ebbb.xml"
  },
